      "materialization_defect_count": 0,
      "proposed_fix_still_worth_making": "the right band context is 0.04 of the line length against 0.16 on the left, which leaves the last digit about 0.8 pitches from the band edge against 2.6 for the first. Symmetrising it costs nothing and gives the last digit the same surround as the first, but it does not recover a digit that is not visible.",
